  /* ═══ MÓDULO: AccessibilityManager ═══
     ID: M21
     SPEC: 3.13 (Acessibilidade)
     DEPENDE DE: SidePanel (M08), BottomSheet (M09)
     RECEBE: DOM events
     EXPÕE: announceAria(msg), (focus trap in M08/M09)
     ESTADO: nenhum
     NOTE: Accessibility features distributed across modules:
       - ESC closes: M08, M09
       - Focus trap: M08.setupFocusTrap()
       - aria-label: all pins (M05), controls (Liquid markup M23)
